Z||000009||William||02-08-2001||12:37 AM||||This weekend I will post some pics of my new Black /Tan Interior. It's got a fully black dash, gauge pod, radio pod, shifter console, and Map pocket. The wheel and shift knob is black leather also. All the trim plates are now mirror black!! The seats, sunvisors, doors, armrests, and e-brake boot are all light buckskin leather. The firewall and header are being done in black perforated vinyl. It's really starting to look like the black Tan interior in the Ferarri 308, and I'm quite proud of it. I'm just itching to show everyone! <P>P.S. Hey Shiner... Mines done. Have you started your black / tan interior yet? hehe j/k||||reg||1
